+### Prose and ops, since those were the priorities
+
+* **Ops.** `json-log-40 347→188`, `csv-60 413→267`, `rle 202→60`,
+  `idrun 200→101`, `grid 131→62`, `agent-turn 355→222`, `two-regime 445→324`,
